# AI Talent Matrix Rules

The architecture PDF is the source of truth.

## Stack (do not change)

| Layer | Service |
|-------|---------|
| Database | **Supabase** (PostgreSQL) |
| Authentication | **Supabase Auth** |
| Storage | **Cloudinary** |
| Vector DB | **Qdrant Cloud** |
| Frontend | **Next.js App Router** |
| Gateway | **Node.js Express** |
| AI services | **Python FastAPI** |

## Constraints

- Never replace Supabase with local PostgreSQL.
- Never recommend Docker unless the user explicitly asks.
- Prefer free-tier services.
- Never redesign the architecture — only implement it.
- The architecture PDF overrides conflicting code or docs in the repo.

## Request flow

```
Next.js → Express Gateway → FastAPI (AI) / Supabase / Cloudinary / Qdrant
```
